# MASTER PROMPT — YouTube-Inspired Video Editing Portfolio with Secure Admin Dashboard

## 1. Your Role

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, video platform architect, and application security engineer.

Build a complete, production-ready, responsive video-editing portfolio website that feels like a modern video-sharing platform inspired by YouTube. It must showcase both vertical Shorts and long-form video projects while presenting me as a professional video editor and helping me attract clients.

This must be a functional website, not just a UI mockup or landing page.

**Required deployment workflow:** Google AI Studio → GitHub → Vercel.

Use a modern, maintainable stack compatible with Vercel. Prefer Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and a suitable backend such as Supabase for authentication, database and storage.

Do not stop after generating the homepage. Implement the complete website, backend integration, admin dashboard, authentication, data models, responsive layouts, and deployment instructions.

