- Mobile layout designed specifically for touch and vertical video.
- Light mode may be offered as an optional theme, but dark mode is the default.

The interface should look professional enough to impress marketing agencies, creators, brands, businesses and potential editing clients.

Do not use generic template styling, oversized gradients everywhere, excessive glassmorphism, or decorative elements that distract from the videos.

